    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ma vie en rogue is a roguelike  spanning multiple themed dungeons and worlds bringing advancements such as a mini-map, first-person view, and paperdoll customization to the genre.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to plumb the dungeon's mysteries?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modern features include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themed &quot;worlds&quot;: Adventure in different environments!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1st- and 3rd-person view!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggleable mini-map! Keep an eye on your location, or turn it off for extra immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty slider: Adjust your challenge level!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paperdoll character display! See what you are wearing and wielding.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>With plenty of old-school cool:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn pixel art textures, monsters, and items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath option: For your traditional rogue-style fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based action! Play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggleable TV filter effect! Just like your old CRT monitor.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personalize your character any way you want!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character creator: Make a player that looks just like you, or try something completely different!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unrestricted color choices for hair and skin. Be green with blue hair, purple with yellow hair; the sky's the limit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your companion! Which pet will be your favorite?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name yourself and your pet what you like, or use the random name generator for unique fantasy names!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging and fun!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of monsters to fight, each with its own style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of magic items, weapons and armor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster taming: Collect new companions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly NPCs can offer helpful (or unhelpful!) advice and clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricky maze levels!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ma vie en rogue is a roguelike  spanning multiple themed dungeons and worlds bringing advancements such as a mini-map, first-person view, and paperdoll customization to the genre.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to plumb the dungeon's mysteries?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modern features include:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themed &quot;worlds&quot;: Adventure in different environments!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1st- and 3rd-person view!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggleable mini-map! Keep an eye on your location, or turn it off for extra immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty slider: Adjust your challenge level!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paperdoll character display! See what you are wearing and wielding.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>With plenty of old-school cool:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn pixel art textures, monsters, and items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath option: For your traditional rogue-style fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based action! Play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggleable TV filter effect! Just like your old CRT monitor.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personalize your character any way you want!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character creator: Make a player that looks just like you, or try something completely different!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unrestricted color choices for hair and skin. Be green with blue hair, purple with yellow hair; the sky's the limit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your companion! Which pet will be your favorite?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name yourself and your pet what you like, or use the random name generator for unique fantasy names!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging and fun!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of monsters to fight, each with its own style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of magic items, weapons and armor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster taming: Collect new companions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly NPCs can offer helpful (or unhelpful!) advice and clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricky maze levels!</p></li></ul>",
